	(text "Auxillary power control to allow extremely low power usage when asleep\nWhen AUX_SW is high the +3.3V_AUX and +5V_AUX rails are enabled\nThe aux rails power the relay feedback pins, CAN chips and L9637D.\n\nThe I2C bus (accelerometer/INA228) don't use these rails as backfeeding causes issues and they\nhave inherent low power states anyway."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 179.832 173.482 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
